      "body": "Enviro Infra Engineers Limited appointed Dr. Mukul Jain (DIN: 07187651) as Non-Executive Independent Director of the Company for a period of five years, effective from October 4, 2025, following the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee and approval of the shareholders through remote e-voting via postal ballot with requisite majority on January 1, 2026. Dr. Mukul Jain is a mechanical engineering graduate with three post-graduations in different domains of management, namely Operations, Finance & HR. He holds a Ph.D. degree in the subject of behavioural finance. He is a Corporate Trainer and visiting Professor in management domain with various business institutes. Dr. Mukul Jain is not related to any of the Directors of the Company.",
